5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We should focus on the human element of the transition. I want to see how previous rollouts affected the staff.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm worried about the actual gear in the yards! We need a system that works with our old equipment and busy schedule.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I believe we need to look closer at the long-term financial commitments and how costs evolve after the initial contract.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I want to make sure we have clear ownership when things go wrong and that our plans stay realistic!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A fascinating list. I suspect the ghosts of our past technical debts are hiding in the upgrade logs and old data migrations.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Yumi, I agree that ownership is key, but the burden on the actual operators is what concerns me most.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Exactly! If the system crashes during peak season, the freight doesn't just stop moving. We have to be ready.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Kenji, stability is important, but stability often comes with hidden maintenance costs that aren't in the brochure.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"That's a good point, Toshio! I just want us all to be happy and not stressed when the system goes live!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. It would be a tragedy to purchase a shiny new tool only to find it's built on a foundation of sand.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
